Helm Dependencies
Lab Objectives
By the end of this lab, you will be able to:

Understand the concept of Helm chart dependencies
Add dependencies to a Helm chart using the Chart.yaml file
Configure dependency repositories and versions
Install and manage dependent charts together as a single deployment
