Troubleshooting Common Issues
Issue 1: Dependency Download Failures
If dependencies fail to download:

# Clear Helm cache
rm -rf ~/.cache/helm/repository/*

# Re-add repositories
helm repo add bitnami https://charts.bitnami.com/bitnami
helm repo update

# Try dependency update again
helm dependency update
Issue 2: Version Conflicts
If you encounter version conflicts:

# Check available versions
helm search repo bitnami/redis --versions

# Update Chart.yaml with compatible versions
# Then run dependency update
helm dependency update
Issue 3: Template Rendering Issues
If templates fail to render:

# Debug template rendering
helm template . --debug

# Check for syntax errors
helm lint .

# Verify values are correctly passed
helm template . --set redis.enabled=false --debug
