Helm dependencies are crucial for modern application deployment because they allow you to:

Compose complex applications from reusable components
Manage service relationships effectively in microservices architectures
Maintain consistency across different environments
Simplify deployment processes by bundling related services
Enable selective deployment of application components based on requirements
